{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/fbefa026f2b47a0d113ff4095257223f.webp?t=1774566860\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/fbefa026f2b47a0d113ff4095257223f.poster.avif?t=1774566860\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=292 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Looking Up&quot; is a short,\u00a0<strong>cozy puzzle game</strong>\u00a0where you play as Emilia, a young girl exploring flying through her notebook. Interact with objects and solve visual puzzles to uncover the memories that shaped Emilia\u2019s dream of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/f8ad0a8657a3f48ac2bb433ff60aa255.avif?t=1774566860\" width=1560 height=542 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emilia grows older, the notebook changes. <br>Early pages capture the wonder of childhood discovery, while later moments reveal the effort, doubt, and persistence behind learning to fly. Through these small scenes, her fascination with the sky slowly takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is presented as a page, where puzzles emerge from the objects and the memories within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueroof Games' first project lets players enjoy puzzles in each environment of the notebook, making them think while also immersing them in the magical art style of the studio's debut game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60 minutes playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 puzzle built around personal objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A father\u2013daughter relationship told through small moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and sound design by P\u00e9ter M\u00e1ri</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stick with it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/2c2e38824526b43619c5a935c3fcfc38cfb15a7c.jpg"},{"name":"Gotta start somewhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/9124672a22736c5924c24180b2616d0632f7ebcd.jpg"},{"name":"Birb in da paper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/bdb37a9ed7dcd10401f072d90fe96bc46b189d91.jpg"},{"name":"Sweet dreams are made of... birds?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/d2564fe1a16a24b9261ae524921571279573b6e9.jpg"},{"name":"Birds of a feather...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/33f1ad746019c22072e168e01deb54c1660fd9f5.jpg"},{"name":"Do you see the birbs fly?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/29a39c7dab3159258d0bc1d3914cd71b6b532bd6.jpg"},{"name":"Snug as a bug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/5fc3629c8a59b803c89eede9bc680bea1d3103f8.jpg"},{"name":"As simple as that","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/5d732baf3ca2c02c2a29e14bd8b2c0d0c66a48f7.jpg"},{"name":"What an im-pression!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/25b5565d8f6db06ac4a6a2a51da4ea2e9b6f02d0.jpg"},{"name":"Shapes and colors...and dragonflies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3947980/229056fe84f962a4453776bc642dd9256af08ee4.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947980?t=1774566860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3947980?t=1774566860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/549336924ce3d04ed5e0648445e4ca126c6092a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774566860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/549336924ce3d04ed5e0648445e4ca126c6092a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774566860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4250390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/fbefa026f2b47a0d113ff4095257223f.webp?t=1774566860\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/fbefa026f2b47a0d113ff4095257223f.poster.avif?t=1774566860\" class=\"bb_img\" width=560 height=292 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Looking Up&quot; is a short,\u00a0<strong>cozy puzzle game</strong>\u00a0where you play as Emilia, a young girl exploring flying through her notebook. Interact with objects and solve visual puzzles to uncover the memories that shaped Emilia\u2019s dream of flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/extras/f8ad0a8657a3f48ac2bb433ff60aa255.avif?t=1774566860\" width=1560 height=542 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Emilia grows older, the notebook changes. <br>Early pages capture the wonder of childhood discovery, while later moments reveal the effort, doubt, and persistence behind learning to fly. Through these small scenes, her fascination with the sky slowly takes shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment is presented as a page, where puzzles emerge from the objects and the memories within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blueroof Games' first project lets players enjoy puzzles in each environment of the notebook, making them think while also immersing them in the magical art style of the studio's debut game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60 minutes playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 puzzle built around personal objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A father\u2013daughter relationship told through small moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original music and sound design by P\u00e9ter M\u00e1ri</p></li></ul>","developers":["BlueRoof Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3947980/be0d6f5891dfde9d8952187c2d14119648f4ef4d/header.jpg?t=1774566860","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5 (both supported via Rosetta on Apple Silicon)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 / AMD Radeon / NVIDIA equivalent (Meta